Baltic Shipping rejected the claim this morning, saying the packaging was ins=
ufficient. I do not agree. The pallets had stretch wrap plus corner boards, w=
hich is our standard for this product, and the ceiling of the container showe=
d drip marks. I will push back and ask for a joint survey.

Can you send me the exact invoice and PO values for the 14 damaged pallets? I=
 need them for the dispute letter. Also, please do not book anything against =
the carrier yet.

