We have reviewed claim CLM-2026-0912 and regret that we must reject it. Accor=
ding to the loading record, the pallets were only stretch-wrapped, with no to=
p cover or moisture barrier. Under our terms of carriage, sensitive electroni=
cs must be packed to withstand normal humidity during sea transport. We there=
fore consider insufficient packaging to be the cause of the damage, and the c=
arrier is not liable.

If you disagree, please send additional evidence within 14 days, in particula=
r photos of the packaging before loading and any independent inspection repor=
t.

Best regards,
Baltic Shipping Claims
Short-sea carrier Gdansk

